# Qwen3.8-27B (8-bit) served locally by oMLX on Apple Silicon.
#
# oMLX serves every model under its model dir and dispatches on the requested
# name, so MODEL is not a launch flag — it must be a name oMLX actually has
# (the directory name under the preset's model-dir, or an alias from the admin
# panel); a name it lacks is rejected with "model not found". List what yours
# exposes:
#   curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $OPENAI_API_KEY" http://127.0.0.1:8010/v1/models
#
# This install requires a key even on localhost; the .env beside this file
# supplies OPENAI_API_KEY (spinloop records an env reference, never the key).
PROVIDER omlx
MODEL    Qwen3.8-27B-MLX-8bit
CONTEXT  32768
PRESET   ./preset.ini
BASEURL  http://127.0.0.1:8010/v1
